WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.680
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.950 --> 01:43.920
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.289 --> 01:46.850
[Episode 5]

4
01:47.000 --> 01:48.870
I said I really didn't see her.

5
01:48.870 --> 01:50.930
She just came rushing out of nowhere.

6
01:51.120 --> 01:53.280
And my vehicle's pretty big,

7
01:53.590 --> 01:54.990
so there are blind spots.

8
01:56.000 --> 01:56.789
Um,

9
01:57.710 --> 01:58.350
the emergency room.

10
01:58.350 --> 01:59.509
That way, that way.

11
01:59.509 --> 01:59.920
Okay, okay.

12
01:59.920 --> 02:02.520
She fell off her electric scooter right there.

13
02:03.000 --> 02:03.790
Honey,

14
02:04.950 --> 02:05.810
what happened?

15
02:07.430 --> 02:08.190
Why are you crying?

16
02:08.190 --> 02:09.080
Where's our daughter?

17
02:09.080 --> 02:10.280
What happened to her?

18
02:11.590 --> 02:12.400
Where is she?

19
02:12.800 --> 02:13.590
Where is she?

20
02:15.910 --> 02:17.000
Family of Zhang Jiao,

21
02:17.000 --> 02:18.130
please come with me.

22
02:27.190 --> 02:28.390
What happened to her?

23
02:31.470 --> 02:33.520
The patient has suffered severe traumatic brain injury

24
02:33.520 --> 02:35.450
and developed a brain herniation.

25
02:35.840 --> 02:38.000
Her condition is critical.

26
02:38.960 --> 02:40.030
Without surgery,

27
02:41.750 --> 02:43.410
she may not survive the night.

28
02:45.470 --> 02:46.430
It's all my fault.

29
02:46.430 --> 02:47.750
The... the s-surgery.

30
02:47.800 --> 02:51.000
Yes, we'll go ahead with the surgery, Doctor. We'll do it.

31
02:51.710 --> 02:52.750
None of our doctors here

32
02:52.750 --> 02:54.240
can perform this surgery.

33
02:55.360 --> 02:56.760
We can only do the surgery

34
02:57.240 --> 02:58.120
if a highly skilled specialist

35
02:58.120 --> 02:59.450
is willing to come here.

36
02:59.750 --> 03:00.560
Doctor!

37
03:00.630 --> 03:01.430
Please get up.

38
03:01.520 --> 03:02.560
You can't do this.

39
03:02.960 --> 03:04.400
I... could I

40
03:04.840 --> 03:06.150
ask you to help us

41
03:07.000 --> 03:08.000
find someone?

42
03:08.710 --> 03:10.590
We could take her to a bigger hospital,

43
03:10.590 --> 03:12.400
or bring a specialist here.

44
03:13.080 --> 03:14.960
-Please do the surgery my daughter needs. -I'm begging you.

45
03:14.960 --> 03:16.360
Please save my daughter.

46
03:16.800 --> 03:18.079
I'm begging you.

47
03:19.190 --> 03:20.590
She's still so young.

48
03:20.590 --> 03:21.960
Please...

49
03:21.960 --> 03:23.150
She's so young.

50
04:15.240 --> 04:16.070
I'll do it.

51
04:27.600 --> 04:28.390
I'll do it.

52
04:36.240 --> 04:37.570
Thank you... Thank you!

53
04:37.800 --> 04:38.600
Thank you!

54
04:40.950 --> 04:41.600
Thank you!

55
04:42.310 --> 04:43.040
Thank you...

56
04:45.240 --> 04:46.120
She's lost too much blood.

57
04:46.120 --> 04:46.920
We need an emergency blood transfusion.

58
04:46.920 --> 04:47.830
Start rapid fluid resuscitation.

59
04:47.830 --> 04:49.560
I'll check with the blood bank.

60
04:56.560 --> 04:56.870
[Hand Sanitising Station]

61
04:57.300 --> 04:57.680
[Hand Sanitising Station]

62
04:57.850 --> 05:00.890
[Hand Sanitising Station] [Touch-free Faucet]

63
05:05.160 --> 05:06.000
Blood pressure?

64
05:06.000 --> 05:07.060
Ninety over sixty.

65
05:07.720 --> 05:08.830
Mannitol, 100 mL.

66
05:08.830 --> 05:09.760
Run it wide open.

67
05:17.360 --> 05:19.430
Mannitol, 100 mL. Wide open.

68
05:20.040 --> 05:22.700
Prepare povidone-iodine, hydrogen peroxide,

69
05:22.870 --> 05:23.930
and normal saline.

70
05:28.630 --> 05:29.760
Forceps. Scissors.

71
05:42.360 --> 05:44.490
The patient's scalp is badly damaged,

72
05:45.120 --> 05:45.920
and rock fragments

73
05:45.920 --> 05:48.250
and other debris are visible in the wound.

74
05:50.390 --> 05:51.390
Get me soapy water

75
05:52.040 --> 05:53.270
and sterile gauze.

76
06:04.510 --> 06:05.310
Saline.

77
06:09.040 --> 06:10.120
I said saline!

78
06:10.120 --> 06:11.160
Sorry, Dr. Liu.

79
06:11.430 --> 06:12.390
Focus.

80
06:32.310 --> 06:34.110
Povidone-iodine. Get it ready.

81
06:39.510 --> 06:41.240
Prepare to irrigate the wound.

82
06:41.310 --> 06:41.840
Forceps.

83
06:50.870 --> 06:52.200
Debridement complete.

84
06:52.310 --> 06:54.270
Disinfect again and drape the surgical site.

85
06:54.270 --> 06:55.100
Prepare for surgery.

86
06:55.100 --> 07:00.830
[Fucheng Funeral Services]

87
07:03.150 --> 07:08.960
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

88
07:09.050 --> 07:09.890
[Fucheng Funeral Services]

89
07:22.120 --> 07:23.380
[Fucheng Funeral Services]

90
07:24.660 --> 07:28.170
[Bicycle Parking]

91
07:34.680 --> 07:35.940
What are you two doing?

92
07:41.830 --> 07:43.190
Which funeral home are you from?

93
07:43.190 --> 07:44.270
Business around Xiaoximen

94
07:44.270 --> 07:44.680
has always belonged

95
07:44.680 --> 07:46.040
to 1314 Funeral Services.

96
07:46.040 --> 07:47.720
You'd better learn the rules.

97
07:49.720 --> 07:51.580
And why are you getting physical?

98
07:58.480 --> 07:59.159
[Notice: CCTV in Operation]

99
07:59.180 --> 08:00.010
[Please Behave Appropriately]

100
08:00.050 --> 08:02.580
[Operating Room] [Authorized Personnel Only]

101
08:02.690 --> 08:03.520
[Authorized Personnel Only] [Keep Quiet]

102
08:08.880 --> 08:13.930
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

103
08:16.120 --> 08:16.920
Sis,

104
08:17.360 --> 08:18.560
see those two?

105
08:18.720 --> 08:20.950
They came straight here to steal our business.

106
08:20.950 --> 08:22.410
So, did you two get into it?

107
08:22.830 --> 08:24.230
I put them in their place.

108
08:24.480 --> 08:25.270
You did?

109
08:25.950 --> 08:27.150
Got it under control.

110
08:30.360 --> 08:31.760
Breaking the rules, huh?

111
08:33.789 --> 08:35.549
He looks a lot like that guy

112
08:36.000 --> 08:38.200
from that new-style funeral business.

113
08:38.870 --> 08:40.000
It must be those two.

114
08:41.480 --> 08:42.150
Got it.

115
08:52.150 --> 08:52.750
Hello,

116
08:53.440 --> 08:55.000
I'm the owner of 1314 Funeral Services,

117
08:55.000 --> 08:56.720
and my name is Ai Chen.

118
08:58.320 --> 08:59.360
Xu Jie.

119
09:12.480 --> 09:14.940
Mr. Xu, you're quite impatient, aren't you?

120
09:15.960 --> 09:17.720
The surgery isn't even over,

121
09:18.000 --> 09:21.060
and you're already here trying to snatch the business.

122
09:21.200 --> 09:22.550
To be honest,

123
09:23.630 --> 09:25.840
I haven't been in Fucheng long,

124
09:26.320 --> 09:28.630
but I've already built up a few good connections

125
09:28.630 --> 09:30.090
for getting information.

126
09:31.200 --> 09:32.800
Oh, you've got connections.

127
09:34.510 --> 09:35.550
Xiaoximen Hospital

128
09:35.550 --> 09:37.080
is my territory.

129
09:37.840 --> 09:39.300
But since you're new here,

130
09:39.480 --> 09:40.670
let's consider this a chance to become friends.

131
09:40.670 --> 09:41.750
This job's yours.

132
09:42.480 --> 09:43.550
Go talk to them.

133
09:48.000 --> 09:50.000
Ms. Ai, you're pretty slick.

134
09:51.440 --> 09:52.440
Setting me up, huh?

135
09:52.440 --> 09:53.770
Come on, don't say that.

136
09:53.870 --> 09:54.600
Their kid

137
09:54.600 --> 09:55.550
is still fighting for her life in there.

138
09:55.550 --> 09:57.910
If I go talk to her parents about funeral arrangements now,

139
09:57.910 --> 09:59.360
they'd beat me to death!

140
10:02.630 --> 10:04.200
Let's stay calm

141
10:03.240 --> 10:06.550
[No smoking] [Keep quiet]

142
10:04.630 --> 10:06.200
and wait for the results together.

143
10:06.200 --> 10:06.840
No, no.

144
10:07.670 --> 10:08.930
I said the job's yours.

145
10:10.120 --> 10:11.180
You guys wait here.

146
10:20.960 --> 10:21.390
Chen,

147
10:22.270 --> 10:22.960
how'd it go?

148
10:22.960 --> 10:25.160
They won't budge, no matter what we say.

149
10:25.200 --> 10:26.860
We need to teach them a lesson.

150
10:28.200 --> 10:29.360
Time to take matters into our own hands.

151
10:29.360 --> 10:30.150
What do you have in mind?

152
10:30.150 --> 10:32.880
Do you think I'd come up with something that fast?

153
10:34.510 --> 10:36.370
Keep an eye on things here in a bit.

154
10:36.600 --> 10:38.030
Don't stare now—

155
10:38.030 --> 10:40.030
just keep an eye on them discreetly.

156
10:40.480 --> 10:42.240
I'm going to the inpatient department

157
10:42.240 --> 10:43.390
to talk things over with those two

158
10:43.390 --> 10:45.120
who actually have some brains.

159
10:55.750 --> 10:59.200
[Operating Room Integrated Control System]

160
10:57.150 --> 10:59.680
Anesthesia, we're beginning the procedure.

161
11:13.550 --> 11:14.280
Scalp clips.

162
11:37.480 --> 11:38.840
The skull is shattered.

163
11:38.870 --> 11:41.270
We need to remove the loose bone fragments.

164
12:08.030 --> 12:10.290
Dr. Liu, let me wipe the blood off for you.

165
12:10.630 --> 12:12.290
Clear the epidural hematoma.

166
12:38.440 --> 12:39.510
I can see it.

167
12:39.750 --> 12:40.390
Anesthesiologist,

168
12:40.390 --> 12:42.050
how are the patient's vitals?

169
12:42.600 --> 12:44.000
Blood pressure, 93 over 62.

170
12:44.000 --> 12:44.750
Heart rate, 111.

171
12:44.750 --> 12:46.350
Microscope. Change gloves.

172
12:51.790 --> 12:53.120
Your left hand, Dr. Liu.

173
12:56.070 --> 13:00.590
[Operating Room Integrated Control System]

174
12:59.960 --> 13:01.600
He's getting way too cocky.

175
13:01.600 --> 13:03.800
Don't we need to do something about him?

176
13:04.320 --> 13:05.960
If everyone did what he does—

177
13:06.200 --> 13:07.600
camping outside the operating room

178
13:07.600 --> 13:08.510
and swooping in to snatch the business

179
13:08.510 --> 13:09.870
whenever someone died—

180
13:09.870 --> 13:11.240
wouldn't everything descend into chaos?

181
13:11.240 --> 13:12.840
T-The families would hate us for it.

182
13:12.840 --> 13:13.570
I'm serious.

183
13:14.000 --> 13:15.030
I'm willing to lose money over this,

184
13:15.030 --> 13:15.960
you understand?

185
13:16.030 --> 13:17.760
But I can't let him win this one.

186
13:18.670 --> 13:20.390
Get your dad to bring some people over.

187
13:20.390 --> 13:21.870
We'll take them down.

188
13:22.550 --> 13:23.120
Ms. Mi,

189
13:23.510 --> 13:25.360
it's not that serious. Calm down.

190
13:25.360 --> 13:28.150
What era are we living in? We can't go around fighting people.

191
13:28.150 --> 13:29.750
Violence is the last resort.

192
13:29.910 --> 13:31.360
We need to outsmart them.

193
13:31.390 --> 13:32.270
Right, right.

194
13:32.270 --> 13:33.720
T-That's right.

195
13:33.960 --> 13:35.760
H-How's your brain recovering?

196
13:36.240 --> 13:38.100
T-Try using it... think a little.

197
13:43.240 --> 13:44.440
If we want to guarantee a win,

198
13:44.440 --> 13:46.970
we'll have to try something unconventional.

199
13:49.190 --> 13:55.040
[Bicycle Parking]

200
14:05.060 --> 14:12.170
[Accessible Route—Please Keep Clear]

201
14:25.550 --> 14:26.360
Ma'am,

202
14:27.270 --> 14:28.600
when did this happen?

203
14:30.000 --> 14:32.470
He was doing fine during surgery just now.

204
14:32.670 --> 14:35.000
I don't know what happened.

205
14:35.150 --> 14:36.790
My son...

206
14:36.790 --> 14:38.450
Please take care of yourself.

207
14:38.910 --> 14:40.770
I run a funeral service business.

208
14:41.120 --> 14:42.480
Have you found anyone

209
14:42.480 --> 14:43.670
to handle the funeral arrangements?

210
14:43.670 --> 14:44.630
No.

211
14:45.270 --> 14:47.030
No. It's just me now,

212
14:47.360 --> 14:49.030
-and I don't know anyone who handles that. -How about this?

213
14:49.030 --> 14:51.630
Would it be okay if I took a look at the deceased?

214
15:06.750 --> 15:07.870
He's far too young.

215
15:10.360 --> 15:11.150
Ma'am,

216
15:11.960 --> 15:13.720
we have the best morticians.

217
15:14.120 --> 15:15.510
Don't worry about his missing hair.

218
15:15.510 --> 15:16.840
I promise we'll restore him

219
15:16.840 --> 15:19.270
to exactly how he looked before he passed away.

220
15:19.270 --> 15:20.000
Ma'am,

221
15:20.720 --> 15:22.360
fate brought us together.

222
15:22.870 --> 15:24.030
Would you give me the chance

223
15:24.030 --> 15:26.230
to see your son off on his final journey?

224
15:28.790 --> 15:29.670
It's settled.

225
15:30.790 --> 15:32.110
The hearse is downstairs.

226
15:32.110 --> 15:33.150
We're not taking him to the morgue.

227
15:33.150 --> 15:34.790
We're going straight to the funeral home.

228
15:34.790 --> 15:36.510
I'll take care of everything,

229
15:36.510 --> 15:37.200
from the funeral hall and flowers to the ceremony and the banquet.

230
15:37.200 --> 15:38.480
I'll make sure it's all arranged perfectly.

231
15:38.480 --> 15:40.010
How does that sound, ma'am?

232
15:41.720 --> 15:42.520
It's settled.

233
15:47.480 --> 15:47.910
Gang,

234
15:48.440 --> 15:49.200
forget about the operating room.

235
15:49.200 --> 15:50.080
Meet me on the first floor.

236
15:50.080 --> 15:50.670
Now!

237
15:56.510 --> 15:57.320
Ma'am, ma'am,

238
15:57.440 --> 15:58.240
um...

239
15:58.320 --> 15:59.870
could I take a look

240
15:59.870 --> 16:01.330
at the death certificate?

241
16:08.000 --> 16:09.200
I just had it here.

242
16:09.550 --> 16:10.480
Where did I put it?

243
16:10.480 --> 16:11.440
Look carefully.

244
16:11.960 --> 16:13.750
Without a death certificate from the hospital,

245
16:13.750 --> 16:15.120
the funeral home can't process the paperwork.

246
16:15.050 --> 16:21.050
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

247
16:15.360 --> 16:16.230
Could you

248
16:16.230 --> 16:17.630
take my son there first?

249
16:17.630 --> 16:19.320
I'll bring the certificate over later.

250
16:19.320 --> 16:20.030
Well...

251
16:20.600 --> 16:21.150
Ma'am,

252
16:21.600 --> 16:22.930
ma'am, my condolences.

253
16:23.750 --> 16:24.480
We offer

254
16:24.480 --> 16:25.910
full-service funeral services

255
16:25.910 --> 16:27.110
at the lowest prices,

256
16:27.200 --> 16:28.030
and we're

257
16:28.030 --> 16:30.200
the most professional funeral home in the city.

258
16:30.200 --> 16:31.260
What are you doing?

259
16:32.080 --> 16:33.320
What are you doing here?

260
16:33.320 --> 16:34.670
Look, we're all civilized people here.

261
16:34.670 --> 16:35.870
Ma'am has already chosen my company.

262
16:35.870 --> 16:36.960
Why are you still trying to steal her away?

263
16:36.960 --> 16:39.490
Weren't you supposed to be waiting upstairs?

264
16:39.550 --> 16:40.200
Mr. Xu,

265
16:40.200 --> 16:43.200
you can't just squeeze every last penny out of people.

266
16:45.630 --> 16:46.150
Ma'am,

267
16:47.440 --> 16:48.390
we've got connections at the funeral home.

268
16:48.390 --> 16:49.870
We can sort out the death certificate later.

269
16:49.870 --> 16:50.550
-I-I have connections there too. -Hurry up.

270
16:50.550 --> 16:51.390
Take your son to the funeral hall.

271
16:51.390 --> 16:52.870
Isn't that monopolizing the business?

272
16:52.870 --> 16:54.360
I'm sorry, miss.

273
16:54.360 --> 16:56.480
-They got here first. -I understand, I understand, ma'am.

274
16:56.480 --> 16:56.960
Ma'am.

275
17:12.550 --> 17:13.200
Wait,

276
17:13.720 --> 17:14.920
put him on top of the coffin.

277
17:14.920 --> 17:16.450
We usually put them inside.

278
17:16.960 --> 17:18.109
On top, on top.

279
17:18.880 --> 17:19.880
All right, all right.

280
17:19.880 --> 17:21.750
Come on. One, two, lift!

281
17:25.880 --> 17:26.349
Ma'am,

282
17:26.440 --> 17:29.040
would you like to sit in the front or in the back?

283
17:29.200 --> 17:30.330
I'll sit in the back.

284
17:30.440 --> 17:31.440
I want to spend a little more time

285
17:31.440 --> 17:32.150
with my son.

286
17:33.200 --> 17:33.860
Be careful.

287
17:38.240 --> 17:39.400
Aren't you coming with me?

288
17:39.400 --> 17:41.030
I've still got something to take care of upstairs.

289
17:41.030 --> 17:42.480
But I can't do that.

290
17:44.160 --> 17:45.640
You're the only person I know.

291
17:45.640 --> 17:46.440
If you don't get in,

292
17:46.440 --> 17:47.720
who am I supposed to turn to later?

293
17:47.720 --> 17:48.270
Here,

294
17:48.590 --> 17:49.480
let me give you my business card.

295
17:49.480 --> 17:50.030
If you need anything,

296
17:50.030 --> 17:51.110
just give me a call, okay?

297
17:51.110 --> 17:51.720
No.

298
17:52.400 --> 17:53.680
If you're not getting in,

299
17:53.680 --> 17:55.000
then take my son back down.

300
17:55.000 --> 17:56.550
I'll go find that young woman from earlier.

301
17:56.550 --> 17:57.000
Ma'am,

302
17:57.000 --> 17:58.350
we're a legitimate business.

303
17:58.350 --> 17:59.350
Do you really think we'd cheat you?

304
17:59.350 --> 17:59.680
Look,

305
17:59.680 --> 18:00.960
here's our business license.

306
18:00.960 --> 18:01.790
I don't want to see it. I don't want to see it.

307
18:01.790 --> 18:02.310
I-I...

308
18:02.310 --> 18:03.110
Sir,

309
18:03.110 --> 18:05.160
please help me get my son down from there.

310
18:05.160 --> 18:06.030
Take us to the morgue.

311
18:06.030 --> 18:06.750
No, no.

312
18:06.790 --> 18:08.450
I'll come with you. All right?

313
18:09.000 --> 18:10.530
Why are you so eager to help?

314
18:11.070 --> 18:12.000
How about this, ma'am?

315
18:12.000 --> 18:12.830
I'll take you both there

316
18:12.830 --> 18:13.960
and make sure you're settled in before I leave.

317
18:13.960 --> 18:14.480
Okay?

318
18:17.240 --> 18:18.370
That's more like it.

319
18:33.550 --> 18:34.920
Nice acting, San.

320
18:35.680 --> 18:37.280
What are you calling me, huh?

321
18:41.830 --> 18:42.550
I'd better

322
18:42.550 --> 18:43.640
get upstairs.

323
18:43.750 --> 18:44.440
The results should be out any minute.

324
18:44.440 --> 18:45.790
This is our chance to win the job.

325
18:45.790 --> 18:46.550
Okay.

326
18:46.880 --> 18:48.480
Well, I'll head back first.

327
18:48.830 --> 18:50.240
If you and Cai Zhuzi

328
18:50.680 --> 18:51.880
manage to land the job...

329
18:51.880 --> 18:53.000
I'll let you know.

330
19:17.720 --> 19:19.510
Can you turn the AC up a bit?

331
19:19.680 --> 19:20.480
Gang,

332
19:20.830 --> 19:22.440
turn up the AC in the back.

333
19:22.440 --> 19:23.040
You got it.

334
19:31.590 --> 19:32.510
What's that?

335
19:33.550 --> 19:34.590
What is that thing?

336
19:34.590 --> 19:35.350
What?

337
19:36.030 --> 19:37.960
Is that a big moth flapping around?

338
19:40.000 --> 19:43.000
It's the middle of winter. Where would you find a moth?

339
19:43.030 --> 19:43.590
There's nothing there.

340
19:43.590 --> 19:44.200
No,

341
19:48.270 --> 19:48.830
I...

342
19:48.830 --> 19:51.000
Maybe I've been so overwhelmed with grief lately

343
19:51.000 --> 19:52.400
that I'm hallucinating.

344
19:54.680 --> 19:56.350
I-I understand, ma'am.

345
19:56.510 --> 19:57.440
You still

346
19:59.000 --> 19:59.590
have a long life

347
19:59.590 --> 20:01.510
ahead of you.

348
20:02.640 --> 20:04.300
Please don't grieve too much.

349
20:08.240 --> 20:10.440
I thought I heard something just now...

350
20:17.680 --> 20:18.680
Did you hear that?

351
20:19.680 --> 20:20.590
Hear what?

352
20:20.640 --> 20:21.640
What? No, you...

353
20:21.640 --> 20:22.640
-I didn't hear anything. -S-Stop talking.

354
20:22.640 --> 20:23.550
-Sir. -I heard it just now.

355
20:23.550 --> 20:25.270
-Don't scare me like that! -Stop talking for now.

356
20:25.270 --> 20:28.670
-I'm not scaring you. Stop talking. -I didn't here anything.

357
20:42.070 --> 20:43.160
It's moving!

358
20:44.350 --> 20:45.110
What

359
20:45.790 --> 20:46.880
the hell is that?

360
20:47.720 --> 20:49.070
Let me out!

361
20:50.140 --> 20:56.270
[Fucheng Funeral Services]

362
20:54.680 --> 20:56.350
He's come back from the dead!

363
20:56.400 --> 20:57.920
Begin the intracranial procedure.

364
20:57.920 --> 21:02.250
Evacuate the hematoma and address the cerebral contusions and lacerations.

365
21:02.400 --> 21:03.600
Is the position okay?

366
21:04.240 --> 21:04.880
Yes.

367
21:09.640 --> 21:10.640
Bipolar forceps.

368
21:11.440 --> 21:12.110
Suction.

369
21:24.830 --> 21:26.240
Intracranial pressure is coming down.

370
21:26.240 --> 21:27.640
Brain pulsation is good,

371
21:28.030 --> 21:29.830
and there's no active bleeding.

372
21:29.920 --> 21:31.680
Her life should be out of danger now.

373
21:31.680 --> 21:33.200
It's too soon to relax.

374
21:33.680 --> 21:34.440
The CT scan shows

375
21:34.440 --> 21:36.300
another hematoma deeper inside.

376
21:39.750 --> 21:41.480
Let's adjust the position.

377
22:03.400 --> 22:04.310
We've found it,

378
22:05.350 --> 22:07.350
but it's very close to the thalamus.

379
22:07.750 --> 22:09.000
It's too deep.

380
22:09.310 --> 22:10.880
It'll be difficult to operate there.

381
22:10.880 --> 22:11.790
If we leave it,

382
22:12.110 --> 22:13.680
the patient faces a high risk

383
22:13.680 --> 22:15.510
of hydrocephalus and cerebral edema,

384
22:15.510 --> 22:16.350
which could also

385
22:16.350 --> 22:17.550
affect her recovery.

386
22:18.240 --> 22:19.700
Are you going to remove it?

387
22:26.350 --> 22:27.310
Dr. Liu,

388
22:27.310 --> 22:29.310
the intraventricular hematoma is too deep.

389
22:29.310 --> 22:30.680
Should we remove it?

390
22:30.680 --> 22:31.310
Yes.

391
22:32.070 --> 22:33.510
If we leave it now,

392
22:33.680 --> 22:34.750
we're leaving the patient

393
22:34.750 --> 22:36.010
at risk after surgery.

394
22:38.240 --> 22:39.480
The patient is developing an arrhythmia.

395
22:39.480 --> 22:41.160
Blood pressure is dropping rapidly.

396
22:41.160 --> 22:42.310
Sixty over forty.

397
22:45.350 --> 22:46.880
I understand

398
22:47.000 --> 22:48.600
how much you want to make sure

399
22:48.720 --> 22:50.590
this surgery is done thoroughly.

400
22:51.640 --> 22:53.030
But no matter what,

401
22:53.880 --> 22:54.750
if the patient dies

402
22:54.750 --> 22:56.080
on the operating table,

403
22:56.680 --> 22:57.920
the family will see it

404
22:58.160 --> 22:59.550
as your fault.

405
22:59.830 --> 23:01.240
You're not as exceptional

406
23:01.240 --> 23:02.400
as you think you are.

407
23:08.110 --> 23:08.960
Dr. Liu,

408
23:09.270 --> 23:10.640
the collapsed brain tissue is swelling,

409
23:10.640 --> 23:12.310
and intracranial pressure is increasing.

410
23:12.310 --> 23:13.200
Blood pressure has climbed

411
23:13.200 --> 23:14.070
from 120 to 150.

412
23:25.200 --> 23:26.510
The hematoma is so deep.

413
23:26.510 --> 23:28.240
Are we still going to remove it?

414
23:28.720 --> 23:29.240
Yes.

415
23:30.070 --> 23:33.070
We can't leave anything behind that could pose a risk.

416
23:38.010 --> 23:43.000
[Starry Night] [Xiaoximen Hospital]

417
23:54.100 --> 23:55.850
[Authorized Personnel Only] [Keep Quiet]

418
24:14.050 --> 24:16.660
[Please Press the Bell—Do Not Pull]

419
24:16.510 --> 24:17.440
The surgery was successful.

420
24:16.740 --> 24:19.260
[Operating Room] [Authorized Personnel Only]

421
24:17.790 --> 24:19.990
The patient is out of immediate danger.

422
24:20.160 --> 24:21.400
-Thank you. -Thank you.

423
24:21.400 --> 24:22.200
Get up.

424
24:22.350 --> 24:23.680
Come on, get up. I can't hold you up much longer.

425
24:23.680 --> 24:24.350
I'll leave her in your hands.

426
24:24.350 --> 24:25.790
Thank you, Doctor. Thank you.

427
24:25.790 --> 24:26.440
Thank you.

428
24:28.510 --> 24:29.440
The hematoma evacuation

429
24:29.440 --> 24:30.720
went well.

430
24:30.830 --> 24:31.790
Intracranial pressure

431
24:31.790 --> 24:33.880
was significantly relieved after hematoma evacuation.

432
24:33.880 --> 24:35.480
Her condition is fairly stable for now.

433
24:35.480 --> 24:36.160
However...

434
24:50.920 --> 24:51.790
Dr. Liu,

435
24:52.000 --> 24:53.260
how did the surgery go?

436
24:56.110 --> 24:57.510
What's going on with him?

437
25:25.640 --> 25:26.310
Thank you.

438
25:31.660 --> 25:34.080
[Department of Neurosurgery]

439
25:32.640 --> 25:33.440
Zhengliang.

440
25:34.150 --> 25:36.690
[Doctor's Office]

441
25:34.750 --> 25:36.810
you performed a remarkable surgery.

442
25:47.880 --> 25:49.790
Director, your phone's ringing.

443
25:50.780 --> 25:52.830
[Doctor's Office]

444
25:53.070 --> 25:54.930
Director, your phone's ringing.

445
26:18.960 --> 26:19.750
Hello?

446
26:20.070 --> 26:21.600
Hi, is this Liu Zhengliang?

447
26:23.160 --> 26:23.960
Speaking.

448
26:24.680 --> 26:26.920
I'm calling from East Suburb Police Station.

449
26:26.920 --> 26:27.680
Your younger brother

450
26:27.680 --> 26:28.880
is here with us.

451
26:28.920 --> 26:30.050
Could you come down?

452
26:33.030 --> 26:34.440
Okay, I'll be right there.

453
26:34.440 --> 26:35.640
Please wait a moment.

454
27:14.480 --> 27:15.270
She's alive?

455
27:19.350 --> 27:20.240
Okay, okay.

456
27:20.400 --> 27:22.350
Next time, get your facts straight first,

457
27:22.350 --> 27:23.070
all right?

458
27:24.680 --> 27:26.030
You had me running around like crazy,

459
27:26.030 --> 27:26.880
making me dig all this stuff up,

460
27:26.880 --> 27:28.400
and now you...

461
27:28.680 --> 27:30.750
Well, I didn't see that coming either.

462
27:30.750 --> 27:32.640
I'm honestly amazed.

463
27:32.830 --> 27:34.750
She was in such bad shape, and they still managed to save her.

464
27:34.750 --> 27:35.880
That's incredible.

465
27:36.110 --> 27:37.880
Anyway, you don't have to stay up all night anymore.

466
27:37.880 --> 27:39.010
Just get some sleep.

467
27:55.240 --> 27:56.160
Hi.

468
28:05.260 --> 28:07.940
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

469
28:08.710 --> 28:11.000
[Fucheng City Taxi]

470
28:11.270 --> 28:12.880
T-This is my taxi.

471
28:13.350 --> 28:15.110
Aren't you going to the East Suburb Police Station?

472
28:15.110 --> 28:15.830
How'd you know?

473
28:15.830 --> 28:16.640
We're headed to the same place.

474
28:16.640 --> 28:17.240
Hop in.

475
28:22.790 --> 28:24.190
[Fucheng City Taxi]

476
28:24.260 --> 28:27.480
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

477
28:44.270 --> 28:46.130
Although no actual harm was done,

478
28:46.830 --> 28:48.690
deceiving people is still wrong.

479
28:49.200 --> 28:49.960
If Xiaoping hadn't

480
28:49.960 --> 28:51.000
kept putting in a good word for you,

481
28:51.000 --> 28:53.060
I wouldn't have let you off so easily.

482
28:53.750 --> 28:55.950
Go home and reflect on what you've done.

483
28:56.110 --> 28:57.030
Yes, we will.

484
28:59.000 --> 28:59.790
Ms. Mi,

485
29:00.440 --> 29:01.880
you've got a good life,

486
29:02.440 --> 29:05.310
yet you keep getting involved in these shady dealings.

487
29:05.310 --> 29:06.440
What am I supposed to say to you?

488
29:06.440 --> 29:07.240
Yes.

489
29:07.790 --> 29:09.790
Mr. Song, you're absolutely right.

490
29:10.110 --> 29:10.790
Mom.

491
29:11.160 --> 29:13.360
I'll make sure it doesn't happen again.

492
29:16.550 --> 29:17.410
Hey, young man.

493
29:18.070 --> 29:20.790
In this freezing weather, you're wearing a T-shirt,

494
29:20.790 --> 29:22.000
thin pants,

495
29:22.550 --> 29:23.350
and slippers.

496
29:24.590 --> 29:26.880
I just came straight from the operating room.

497
29:26.880 --> 29:27.880
I didn't even have time

498
29:27.880 --> 29:28.750
to change.

499
29:29.070 --> 29:30.110
You're a doctor?

500
29:30.640 --> 29:31.200
Yes.

501
29:32.310 --> 29:32.790
Here,

502
29:34.960 --> 29:36.360
take these and keep warm.

503
29:36.720 --> 29:37.790
We've got more in the duty room.

504
29:37.790 --> 29:38.790
Are you sure it's okay?

505
29:38.790 --> 29:39.590
Take them.

506
29:40.920 --> 29:42.270
Thank you, Officer.

507
29:42.480 --> 29:43.310
I'll bring them

508
29:43.310 --> 29:44.550
back after my shift

509
29:44.550 --> 29:45.720
tomorrow morning.

510
29:45.750 --> 29:47.480
No need. I'll come pick them up.

511
29:48.200 --> 29:49.590
Which hospital do you work at?

512
29:49.590 --> 29:50.790
Xiaoximen Hospital.

513
29:54.480 --> 29:56.410
In that case, just bring them to me.

514
30:00.030 --> 30:00.640
Okay.

515
30:00.960 --> 30:02.290
I'll bring them. I will.

516
30:08.590 --> 30:09.520
Liu Zhengguang,

517
30:09.640 --> 30:10.790
look at you now.

518
30:11.400 --> 30:13.660
Since when did you learn to lie and cheat?

519
30:15.750 --> 30:16.590
I'm talking to you!

520
30:16.590 --> 30:17.720
Cat got your tongue?

521
30:19.590 --> 30:20.400
Listen,

522
30:21.400 --> 30:22.550
wasn't I just

523
30:22.790 --> 30:24.510
in that body bag?

524
30:24.790 --> 30:25.720
I fell asleep

525
30:25.720 --> 30:27.450
for a few minutes, then woke up.

526
30:27.960 --> 30:29.310
It was pitch-black.

527
30:29.310 --> 30:30.400
And suddenly, it hit me.

528
30:30.400 --> 30:31.460
Mom is still alive.

529
30:33.270 --> 30:34.270
Don't think

530
30:34.270 --> 30:35.480
you can change the subject

531
30:35.480 --> 30:36.720
by spouting this nonsense.

532
30:36.720 --> 30:38.720
When we get back, you're going to explain yourself.

533
30:38.720 --> 30:39.640
What nonsense?

534
30:39.640 --> 30:41.100
Who's spouting nonsense?

535
30:41.310 --> 30:42.750
A mother and her child share a special bond, you know?

536
30:42.750 --> 30:44.550
T-The heart can sense it.

537
30:45.920 --> 30:47.270
Mom's definitely still alive.

538
30:47.270 --> 30:48.510
She's gone somewhere quiet

539
30:48.510 --> 30:49.830
to enjoy the time she has left.

540
30:49.830 --> 30:50.880
That's enough. Shut up.

541
30:50.770 --> 30:54.290
[Police]

542
30:54.350 --> 30:55.880
You need to recover from surgery.

543
30:55.880 --> 30:56.830
You're coming back to the hospital with me.

544
30:56.830 --> 30:57.720
I'm serious! I...

545
30:57.720 --> 30:59.920
-I'm telling the truth. -Get in the car.

546
31:01.060 --> 31:04.120
♪ A soul that came to earth amid the cries ♪

547
31:01.240 --> 31:02.110
See you, Aunt Mi.

548
31:02.010 --> 31:05.530
[Police]

549
31:02.510 --> 31:04.310
-Hurry up and go back. -Bye-bye.

550
31:04.600 --> 31:07.770
♪ Welcome to this city of haste ♪

551
31:06.350 --> 31:07.350
We're going home.

552
31:07.750 --> 31:09.270
Mom, you're not wearing enough today.

553
31:08.240 --> 31:10.430
♪ Grow taller, quick as you can ♪

554
31:09.270 --> 31:10.840
I should have brought you a jacket.

555
31:10.840 --> 31:13.190
♪ Learn how to find your footing ♪

556
31:11.070 --> 31:11.930
It's freezing.

557
31:15.430 --> 31:18.700
♪ A soul who hid among the lanes and alleys ♪

558
31:17.590 --> 31:18.790
What are you doing?

559
31:18.790 --> 31:20.110
What's taking you so long?

560
31:19.180 --> 31:22.400
♪ A single turn, and the lamp at the door grows distant ♪

561
31:20.110 --> 31:21.510
We're freezing our butts off here!

562
31:20.250 --> 31:24.330
[1314 Funeral Services]

563
31:22.830 --> 31:23.720
Exactly.

564
31:22.840 --> 31:25.150
♪ The ticket bears no way back ♪

565
31:25.110 --> 31:25.880
All right,

566
31:25.480 --> 31:27.860
♪ How like life it is ♪

567
31:26.070 --> 31:27.330
why is it so cold today?

568
31:28.030 --> 31:28.750
Get in.

569
31:28.750 --> 31:29.280
Alright.

570
31:29.960 --> 31:30.590
Let's go.

571
31:30.050 --> 31:33.350
♪ One who nestled close on a winter's night ♪

572
31:30.590 --> 31:31.350
Let's go

573
31:33.710 --> 31:36.900
♪ A bite of food beside a pool of gaze ♪

574
31:37.460 --> 31:39.580
♪ When summer dusk arrives ♪

575
31:40.020 --> 31:42.130
♪ We'll go to see the flowers ♪

576
31:44.620 --> 31:47.870
♪ One who was stranded on the road ♪

577
31:48.280 --> 31:51.410
♪ Heels buried under unseen snow ♪

578
31:51.550 --> 31:52.350
I'll do it!

579
31:51.900 --> 31:54.140
♪ Don't panic—the journey is long ♪

580
31:54.510 --> 31:57.030
♪ Long enough to hold your pause ♪

581
31:56.830 --> 31:58.110
The surgery was successful.

582
31:58.110 --> 31:59.510
The patient is out of immediate danger.

583
31:59.190 --> 32:01.660
♪ May every road you take be safe ♪

584
32:00.350 --> 32:02.070
-Thank you. -Thank you.

585
32:01.830 --> 32:05.920
♪ May the scenery stay simple and carry you past regret ♪

586
32:06.440 --> 32:09.480
♪ Love deeply whatever comes to meet you ♪

587
32:10.010 --> 32:12.950
♪ And let those who leave be buried under snow on the hills ♪

588
32:13.720 --> 32:16.140
♪ May you come home covered in dust ♪

589
32:15.310 --> 32:16.110
Sweetheart,

590
32:16.470 --> 32:20.350
♪ Held by what you love as you roam the world and return ♪

591
32:16.880 --> 32:18.010
what's on your mind?

592
32:19.160 --> 32:20.270
I was thinking

593
32:21.240 --> 32:23.070
about that little girl we saved today.

594
32:21.500 --> 32:25.900
♪ Saying the flowers by the door are truly beautiful ♪

595
32:24.590 --> 32:25.990
It's been weighing on me.

596
32:26.880 --> 32:28.160
When I saw her,

597
32:28.160 --> 32:29.750
there was a pool of blood on the ground.

598
32:29.750 --> 32:31.720
I scooped her up and ran straight to the hospital.

599
32:31.720 --> 32:32.470
I mean,

600
32:33.240 --> 32:34.830
you'd think someone in my line of work

601
32:34.830 --> 32:36.030
would've seen it all.

602
32:37.200 --> 32:39.310
But she's the first person

603
32:39.310 --> 32:40.590
who nearly died in my arms.

604
32:40.590 --> 32:42.350
You must've gotten it wrong.

605
32:43.750 --> 32:44.590
They said

606
32:45.160 --> 32:46.310
it wasn't that serious.

607
32:46.310 --> 32:47.240
Oh, come on!

608
32:47.240 --> 32:48.510
Am I talking nonsense?

609
32:48.510 --> 32:49.590
She was so close to me.

610
32:49.590 --> 32:51.160
I saw her eyes roll back.

611
32:51.160 --> 32:53.020
Look at all this dried blood on me!

612
32:53.830 --> 32:55.000
One of the doctors

613
32:55.000 --> 32:55.960
even said something

614
32:55.960 --> 32:57.590
about her brain being exposed.

615
32:57.590 --> 32:59.000
And they still saved her?

616
32:59.110 --> 33:00.170
He's just amazing.

617
33:01.270 --> 33:02.310
I mean

618
33:03.160 --> 33:04.720
Zhengguang's older brother.

619
33:04.720 --> 33:05.720
He's incredible.

620
33:06.070 --> 33:06.790
When he

621
33:07.400 --> 33:08.730
came out, he was so calm,

622
33:09.350 --> 33:10.640
never rushing.

623
33:10.640 --> 33:12.440
In this really deep voice,

624
33:12.720 --> 33:13.790
he told the family,

625
33:14.550 --> 33:16.410
"She's out of immediate danger."

626
33:16.790 --> 33:18.310
Then he turned and walked away.

627
33:18.310 --> 33:19.640
The way he walked off...

628
33:20.750 --> 33:22.510
so cool. Seriously.

629
33:22.590 --> 33:24.200
Now I get why his name

630
33:24.640 --> 33:25.500
is Zhengliang.

631
33:26.160 --> 33:28.020
Because "liang" means "bright,"

632
33:28.720 --> 33:29.960
like shining light.

633
33:29.960 --> 33:31.360
You know what I mean, Dad?

634
33:32.400 --> 33:33.550
You get it, Mom?

635
33:33.550 --> 33:34.480
Shining bright.

636
33:35.070 --> 33:36.640
Back when your dad

637
33:37.070 --> 33:38.880
would walk around the train station

638
33:38.880 --> 33:39.750
and come back with three wallets

639
33:39.750 --> 33:40.830
and six watches,

640
33:41.240 --> 33:42.350
I felt the same way.

641
33:43.110 --> 33:45.170
I'm not bragging about my glory days.

642
33:45.830 --> 33:46.960
Crime

643
33:47.350 --> 33:48.110
is wrong.

644
33:50.030 --> 33:51.350
Sweetheart, sweetheart,

645
33:51.350 --> 33:52.750
you've got a crush on him?

646
33:52.880 --> 33:54.000
So what are you gonna do?

647
33:54.000 --> 33:55.860
I'm gonna get him, no matter what.

648
33:59.510 --> 34:00.550
Honestly,

649
34:00.750 --> 34:03.280
the sight of him walking away really got to me.

650
34:03.510 --> 34:04.240
I was gonna make my move

651
34:04.240 --> 34:05.440
right then and there,

652
34:05.790 --> 34:07.160
but then I thought, he's at work and all,

653
34:07.160 --> 34:08.440
so I'd better hold back a little.

654
34:08.440 --> 34:09.370
Here's the plan.

655
34:09.400 --> 34:10.360
Tomorrow,

656
34:10.480 --> 34:13.110
I'll start by taking over that shop

657
34:13.190 --> 34:14.280
across from Xiaoximen Hospital.

658
34:14.280 --> 34:15.110
Then I'll head over to Xiaoximen Hospital

659
34:15.110 --> 34:16.110
and make him mine.

660
34:16.710 --> 34:17.590
Just like me.

661
34:17.840 --> 34:18.670
You bet.

662
34:23.760 --> 34:26.110
Liu Zhengliang

663
34:27.070 --> 34:29.190
is Li Zhongling's eldest son, right?

664
34:30.000 --> 34:31.760
Doesn't he have a condition?

665
34:32.030 --> 34:33.030
So what if he does?

666
34:33.030 --> 34:34.320
He can get treatment.

667
34:34.510 --> 34:35.550
What if he can't be cured?

668
34:35.550 --> 34:36.550
Then so be it.

669
34:37.670 --> 34:39.840
Look, I've got kleptomania, too.

670
34:39.840 --> 34:41.190
Has that been cured?

671
34:41.670 --> 34:42.800
I get restless

672
34:43.960 --> 34:45.489
if I don't steal something.

673
34:46.230 --> 34:47.110
So what?

674
34:47.670 --> 34:50.440
Worst comes to worst, every time I have an episode,

675
34:50.440 --> 34:53.040
I'll turn myself in and face the consequences.

676
34:58.550 --> 34:59.410
Check this out.

677
35:01.800 --> 35:02.590
Amy!

678
35:04.230 --> 35:05.090
I just took this

679
35:05.320 --> 35:07.880
from Mr. Song's desk.

680
35:08.280 --> 35:10.480
Mr. Song didn't even notice.

681
35:10.920 --> 35:11.440
You—

682
35:23.550 --> 35:24.190
Sorry!

683
35:25.280 --> 35:26.940
Mr. Song, we were wrong again.

684
35:37.050 --> 35:43.510
[Emergency]

685
35:38.320 --> 35:39.070
Doctor,

686
35:39.710 --> 35:40.840
when will my daughter

687
35:40.840 --> 35:41.960
wake up?

688
35:43.030 --> 35:44.030
Didn't

689
35:44.670 --> 35:47.230
Dr. Liu explain this to you before the surgery?

690
35:47.230 --> 35:49.290
There's no guarantee she'll wake up.

691
35:49.760 --> 35:51.820
You need to be prepared for that, too.

692
35:55.360 --> 35:55.880
Okay.

693
35:57.230 --> 35:58.000
Dr. Che,

694
35:58.320 --> 36:00.000
please give my daughter

695
36:00.230 --> 36:02.000
whatever good medications she needs.

696
36:02.000 --> 36:03.960
Money's no object.

697
36:10.190 --> 36:11.920
Let's see how things go first.

698
36:11.920 --> 36:13.000
If there's really no improvement...

699
36:13.000 --> 36:14.110
Hi, I wanted to ask

700
36:14.230 --> 36:15.590
if Zhang Jiao was transferred

701
36:14.290 --> 36:22.500
[Emergency] [Red Zone]

702
36:15.590 --> 36:16.670
to the ICU after surgery.

703
36:16.670 --> 36:18.190
No, she's still in there.

704
36:19.000 --> 36:19.630
-Okay, thank you. -No problem.

705
36:19.630 --> 36:20.560
You're welcome.

706
36:51.510 --> 36:52.150
President.

707
36:52.150 --> 36:53.480
Have a seat. Sit down.

708
36:53.800 --> 36:55.860
I just want to talk to you for a minute.

709
36:56.710 --> 36:59.240
You've worked with Liu Zhengliang twice now.

710
36:59.710 --> 37:01.440
What do you think of his skills?

711
37:03.320 --> 37:04.840
In terms of surgical skills alone,

712
37:04.840 --> 37:05.760
I'd say

713
37:05.920 --> 37:07.070
even Director Nie at No. 1 Hospital

714
37:07.070 --> 37:08.070
can't match him.

715
37:15.190 --> 37:15.840
Doctor,

716
37:16.320 --> 37:16.920
thank you.

717
37:16.920 --> 37:17.840
Thank you, Doctor.

718
37:17.840 --> 37:18.360
Thank you.

719
37:18.360 --> 37:19.290
You're welcome.

720
37:20.510 --> 37:21.590
In Shenzhen, someone like him

721
37:21.590 --> 37:23.480
would've been fired just like that.

722
37:23.480 --> 37:25.800
Just goes to show the gap in medical standards.

723
37:25.800 --> 37:27.030
Since you're all here,

724
37:27.030 --> 37:27.550
I—

725
37:30.510 --> 37:32.240
I know what you're going to say.

726
37:33.030 --> 37:34.430
You want to leave, right?

727
37:35.360 --> 37:37.400
Saving that girl was your choice.

728
37:37.920 --> 37:40.850
Now that you've saved her, you have to see it through.

729
37:41.320 --> 37:43.630
You've seen the conditions here for yourself.

730
37:43.630 --> 37:44.800
If you leave

731
37:44.800 --> 37:46.800
and something unexpected happens,

732
37:47.440 --> 37:49.000
you'll never be able to forgive yourself.

733
37:49.000 --> 37:50.330
That's not why I'm here.

734
37:50.880 --> 37:52.400
I wanted to ask why Zhang Jiao

735
37:52.400 --> 37:53.920
wasn't sent to the ICU.

736
37:55.940 --> 38:00.130
[No smoking]

737
37:57.400 --> 38:00.400
That doesn't mean I've changed my mind about leaving.

738
38:02.000 --> 38:03.590
The ICU

739
38:04.190 --> 38:05.190
is too expensive.

740
38:05.880 --> 38:06.840
What if we can't save the girl,

741
38:06.840 --> 38:08.710
but the cost ends up crushing her parents first?

742
38:08.710 --> 38:09.800
But her dad said

743
38:09.800 --> 38:10.480
money was no object.

744
38:10.480 --> 38:11.800
And you believed him?

745
38:12.510 --> 38:13.280
Just look

746
38:13.280 --> 38:14.550
at their situation.

747
38:14.710 --> 38:16.190
Setting aside any judgments based on their appearance,

748
38:16.190 --> 38:16.630
just look at

749
38:16.630 --> 38:17.670
how they had to scrape together

750
38:17.670 --> 38:19.030
2,000–3,000 yuan for medical bills.

751
38:19.030 --> 38:19.800
You can see what kind of financial situation

752
38:19.800 --> 38:21.060
they're in, can't you?

753
38:21.070 --> 38:22.710
Then if they can't afford it, why not just say so?

754
38:22.710 --> 38:24.970
What's the point of pretending they can?

755
38:25.630 --> 38:26.280
Dr. Liu,

756
38:26.550 --> 38:27.840
with all due respect,

757
38:27.840 --> 38:28.550
there are some things

758
38:28.550 --> 38:30.080
you just won't understand.

759
38:30.230 --> 38:32.280
People say that being poor doesn't mean you lack ambition or dignity,

760
38:32.280 --> 38:33.630
but that's true of only a few.

761
38:33.630 --> 38:34.440
The poorer most people get,

762
38:34.440 --> 38:36.070
the less pride they have,

763
38:36.110 --> 38:38.240
so all they can do is put on a brave face.

764
38:38.320 --> 38:39.920
He keeps saying, "Money's no object," over and over.

765
38:39.920 --> 38:41.360
He's not saying it to us.

766
38:41.360 --> 38:42.800
He's saying it to himself. Otherwise,

767
38:42.800 --> 38:44.230
-he wouldn't be able to keep going. -Alright. Alright.

768
38:44.230 --> 38:45.590
You don't have to explain all that to me.

769
38:45.590 --> 38:46.850
Forget the ICU for now.

770
38:47.030 --> 38:47.880
Why didn't you do

771
38:47.880 --> 38:48.710
a ventricular puncture

772
38:48.710 --> 38:50.360
or monitor her intracranial pressure?

773
38:50.360 --> 38:51.880
The tubing for intracranial pressure monitoring

774
38:51.880 --> 38:53.030
costs 3,000 - 4,000 yuan per tube.

775
38:53.030 --> 38:53.710
That's already a lot of money

776
38:53.710 --> 38:54.710
for them.

777
38:54.710 --> 38:55.400
Then how will you

778
38:55.400 --> 38:56.630
monitor her intracranial pressure

779
38:56.630 --> 38:58.150
and test her cerebrospinal fluid going forward?

780
38:58.150 --> 38:59.230
We can do a lumbar puncture.

781
38:59.230 --> 39:00.760
It costs less than 100 yuan.

782
39:01.110 --> 39:03.110
S-So we're just making do with that?

783
39:03.110 --> 39:04.630
That's how small hospitals do it.

784
39:04.630 --> 39:06.290
It's a temporary workaround.

785
39:14.760 --> 39:15.550
A-All right.

786
39:15.550 --> 39:17.070
I'm going to lie down for a while, too.

787
39:17.070 --> 39:17.920
Call me right away

788
39:17.920 --> 39:19.120
if anything happens.

789
39:35.150 --> 39:36.280
Chen Junnan, you...

790
39:36.280 --> 39:37.480
how many times has this happened now?

791
39:37.480 --> 39:38.320
Every time you see a patient,

792
39:38.320 --> 39:39.320
I have to step in and bail you out.

793
39:39.320 --> 39:41.150
I'm about to lose every last shred of dignity.

794
39:41.150 --> 39:41.920
Wait, I—

795
39:42.190 --> 39:43.230
Didn't I call you because

796
39:43.230 --> 39:45.110
I was trying to do right by my patient?

797
39:45.110 --> 39:45.590
Tell me,

798
39:45.590 --> 39:46.710
if I mess up the treatment,

799
39:46.710 --> 39:47.590
won't I embarrass you, too?

800
39:47.590 --> 39:49.280
Now you care about embarrassing me?

801
39:49.280 --> 39:50.510
Every time I go there,

802
39:50.710 --> 39:51.630
you should see the way

803
39:51.630 --> 39:52.710
those nurses look at me.

804
39:52.710 --> 39:53.770
Even the president

805
39:54.400 --> 39:55.530
calls you a screw-up

806
39:56.030 --> 39:57.230
and keeps using you as a topic when talking to me.

807
39:57.230 --> 39:58.000
You didn't even know that, did you?

808
39:58.000 --> 39:59.000
Come on, I told you from the start

809
39:59.000 --> 40:00.280
I didn't want to get into No. 1 Hospital through connections.

810
40:00.280 --> 40:01.550
You insisted on getting me in.

811
40:01.550 --> 40:02.110
And now you're saying

812
40:02.110 --> 40:03.400
I'm embarrassing you.

813
40:03.480 --> 40:05.190
What else could you have done if I hadn't got you in?

814
40:05.190 --> 40:06.110
You should be thanking me!

815
40:06.110 --> 40:06.510
Without me,

816
40:06.510 --> 40:07.440
you'd be a good-for-nothing for the rest of your life.

817
40:07.440 --> 40:08.230
You didn't even realize that, did you?

818
40:08.230 --> 40:09.320
T-Thank you.

819
40:09.320 --> 40:10.030
Fine, fine, thank you.

820
40:10.030 --> 40:10.630
Now get back inside

821
40:10.630 --> 40:11.480
and stop yapping.

822
40:11.480 --> 40:12.740
Look at that attitude!

823
40:12.760 --> 40:13.880
I'm your father!

824
40:13.880 --> 40:14.940
What are you doing?

825
40:15.670 --> 40:16.760
He's been quiet for ages,

826
40:16.760 --> 40:17.550
and you're still going on at him!

827
40:17.550 --> 40:18.110
I was just trying to scare him a little.

828
40:18.110 --> 40:18.840
You can't even do that!

829
40:18.840 --> 40:19.960
Look how old he is.

830
40:19.960 --> 40:21.280
And you're still threatening to whip him with your belt.

831
40:21.280 --> 40:22.070
See that?

832
40:22.280 --> 40:23.710
I'm telling you, he treats me like this

833
40:23.710 --> 40:24.630
at the hospital, too.

834
40:24.630 --> 40:25.590
I have no face left

835
40:25.590 --> 40:27.000
in front of my colleagues.

836
40:27.000 --> 40:28.730
Now you care about saving face?

837
40:28.880 --> 40:29.920
Yes, I do! I want to save face.

838
40:29.920 --> 40:30.760
I'll quit

839
40:30.920 --> 40:32.110
and go work at Xiaoximen Hospital.

840
40:32.110 --> 40:33.000
You quit and see what happens.

841
40:33.000 --> 40:33.630
Let's see if I'll still

842
40:33.630 --> 40:34.760
consider you my son.

843
40:34.960 --> 40:36.190
If you don't, who's gonna take care of you when you're old?

844
40:36.190 --> 40:37.280
T-That's hilarious.

845
40:37.280 --> 40:39.740
Your mom and I can have another kid in no time.

846
40:41.880 --> 40:42.670
You?

847
40:44.960 --> 40:45.820
Go ahead, then.

848
40:48.760 --> 40:50.160
What does he mean by that?

849
40:52.510 --> 40:53.110
Hello,

850
40:53.190 --> 40:55.510
the subscriber you dialed is busy now.

851
40:55.630 --> 40:57.030
Please try again later.

852
40:57.070 --> 40:57.670
Sorry.

853
40:57.960 --> 41:00.670
The subscriber you dialed is busy now.

854
41:00.840 --> 41:02.190
Please try again later.

855
41:01.510 --> 41:02.210
Liu Zhengliang

856
41:02.340 --> 41:03.900
[Calls]

857
41:03.970 --> 41:04.820
Liu Zhengguang

858
41:06.510 --> 41:07.000
Hello?

859
41:08.000 --> 41:09.260
Where's your brother?

860
41:16.880 --> 41:17.630
Tell me,

861
41:17.840 --> 41:19.360
do you think our son was just talking

862
41:19.360 --> 41:19.920
out of anger, or did he mean it?

863
41:19.920 --> 41:20.960
He was definitely just angry.

864
41:20.960 --> 41:22.920
It's not like we're gonna have another kid at our age.

865
41:22.920 --> 41:24.180
That's not what I mean.

866
41:24.400 --> 41:27.000
I'm talking about him wanting to go to Xiaoximen Hospital.

867
41:27.000 --> 41:28.400
He was definitely just angry.

868
41:28.400 --> 41:30.930
What's so special about Xiaoximen Hospital?

869
41:32.070 --> 41:33.280
Then why do I

870
41:33.360 --> 41:34.510
have a bad feeling about this?

871
41:34.510 --> 41:35.440
What do you mean?

872
41:35.960 --> 41:36.960
Think about it.

873
41:37.920 --> 41:38.960
Of all the places he could go,

874
41:38.960 --> 41:40.000
why does he have

875
41:40.320 --> 41:42.150
to go to Xiaoximen Hospital?

876
41:42.280 --> 41:43.140
Think about it.

877
41:43.710 --> 41:45.570
Who's at the Xiaoximen Hospital?

878
41:46.400 --> 41:47.440
Liu Zhengliang?

879
41:47.440 --> 41:48.320
Exactly.

880
41:48.760 --> 41:50.030
Didn't Liu Zhengliang just come back

881
41:50.030 --> 41:51.000
from Shenzhen?

882
41:51.280 --> 41:52.210
I'm telling you,

883
41:52.440 --> 41:54.590
that kid's been exceptional since he was little,

884
41:54.590 --> 41:56.590
and he came back from a big city, too.

885
41:57.670 --> 41:59.000
Do you think our son

886
41:59.360 --> 42:00.510
wants to go

887
42:00.510 --> 42:02.640
to Xiaoximen Hospital because of him?

888
42:04.110 --> 42:04.910
You know what?

889
42:05.670 --> 42:06.320
I'm going

890
42:06.320 --> 42:09.190
to Xiaoximen Hospital tomorrow to check things out.

891
42:09.190 --> 42:10.390
Let's get some sleep.

892
42:11.230 --> 42:12.320
Good grief.

893
42:59.190 --> 42:59.710
One.

894
43:00.480 --> 43:01.110
Two.
